Unified Table

School        Dominant Pillar     Strength                 Limitation
----------------------------------------------------------------------
Logicism      L                   structural clarity       lacks meaning
Formalism     N                   rule consistency         lacks ontology
Intuitionism  M                   cognitive grounding      lacks generality
Platonism     L (+Identity)       ontological commitment   lacks process


